    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>6级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 20，''反射'' 18，''意志'' 16</span><span>''侦查'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 5</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}战蜥人恶臭✦灵气 1</div>\n<div class=description>活体敌人在该灵气内攻击骰受到-2 减值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}木棒（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+11vs.AC命中：7 点伤害。<br>效果：该战蜥人快步最多两格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">散开✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>触发：该战蜥人成为近程或区域攻击的目标。<br>效果（直觉打断）：该战蜥人快步最多两格到一个触发的攻击的效果范围以外的格子。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 18（+7）</span><span>''敏捷'' 13（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 14（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 16（+6）</span><span>''智力'' 4（+0）</span><span>''魅力'' 9（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 龙语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 木棒</span></div></div>\n</div>",
